      "writtenOn": "2020-07-14T17:20:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the logic is correct.  The CC_FRS bit, when set, disables FRS detection on the CC pin.\n\nCan you update the comment to be more explicit on the role of the CC lines here?  If I understand correctly, when CC polarity \u003d\u003d 1  CC2 is connected through to the TCPC and CC1 is used for FRS detection (and vice-versa if CC polarity \u003d\u003d 0).\n\nIt might be good to explicitly enable CCx_BPS for the signal that needs to be connected through to the TCPC in the Vsafe5V path.",
